  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large saucepan over medium heat",
    "Add chopped onion and cook until translucent",
    "Add minced garlic and cook for 1 minute",
    "Add sliced mushroom and cook until tender",
    "Add basmati rice and cook for 2 minutes",
    "Add cooked deep-fry-tod, Comte cheese, salt, and black pepper, and stir well",
    "Reduce heat to low and cover the saucepan",
    "Simmer for 20 minutes or until the rice is cooked and the liquid is absorbed",
    "Garnish with chopped fresh parsley and serve hot"
